ybadge/tsf.png" style="background-color: var(--bgBadgeColor); padding: .66rem .7rem .4rem .5rem; border-radius: .6rem 2.5rem .6rem .6rem; margin: .3rem; border: solid 4px var(--borderColor);" width="64px" alt="tsf.png" class="image" /></a><span class="tooltiptext"><span class="tsf"> </span></span></span></div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:135%;"><strong><tt>SCP ARTICLES:</tt></strong></span></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:135%;"><strong><tt>TALES:</tt></strong></span></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:135%;"><strong><tt>GOIS:</tt></strong></span></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:135%;"><strong><tt>COLLABS:</tt></strong></span></p> </div> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5018" target="_blank">SCP-5018 (FT. IronDruid)</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5963" target="_blank">SCP-5963 (FT. Karakatt)</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.wikidot.com/halfway-lost" target="_blank">Halfway Lost (FT. Greyve, Hexick)</a></li> </ul> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;ACCESS&nbsp;Personnel&nbsp;Report</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;CLOSE&nbsp;Personnel&nbsp;Report</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>JakdragonX, otherwise known as Jaxon █████, is a Foundation employee originating from the United States. His employment began in August of 2019, where he started as a Junior Researcher in Site 19. JakdragonX has since become a Senior Researcher, and as such has dedicated most of his time towards writing and reviewing documented anomalies.</p> <p>Before his introduction to the Foundation, JakdragonX was an amateur boxer and an avid reader. He enjoys reading, writing, and learning about technology/space. JakdragonX has also shown an interest in pataphysical, ectoentropic, and cyber-related anomalies.</p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;ACCESS&nbsp;Fanart&nbsp;Archives</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp; CLOSE&nbsp;Fanart&nbsp;Archives</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5018.gif" alt="5018.gif" class="image" /><br /> This was posted under the permission of its original creator, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5158506&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608952240" alt="Aethris" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5158506)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" >Aethris</a></span>. Its fantastic! <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5963"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5963/medium.jpg" alt="5963" class="image" /></a><br /> This was posted under the permission of its original creator, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hydrails-epsilon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5348862&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608952240" alt="Hydrails-EPSILON" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5348862)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hydrails-epsilon" >Hydrails-EPSILON</a></span>. Its also fantastic! <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5850.png" alt="5850.png" class="image" /><br /> This was posted under the permission of its original creator, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5252186&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608952240" alt="Dr Whitney" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5252186)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" >Dr Whitney</a></span>. Some of the coolest fan art I've ever seen! <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/jakdragonx-rage-collection/5346.jpg" alt="5346.jpg" class="image" /><br /> This wonderful watercolored art is provided courtesy of the 2020 SCP Wiki Gift Exchange! This will be updated later with the original creator. (Please don't ban me ;-;)</div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;ACCESS&nbsp;Documentation&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&gt;&nbsp;CLOSE&nbsp;Documentation&nbsp;Commentary</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><tt>The following information could not be retrieved.