&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;Event-4273-4-CB&lt;br /&gt;
On the 25th of December, ████, SCP-4273 proceeded to manually activate, emitting sounds resembling grinding metal. SCP-4273 proceeded to breach containment, killing 3 personnel and causing massive damage to the site at large&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-302767-17&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;17&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; before exiting the main building, eventually leaving the entirety of site-95. Recovery teams eventually located SCP-4273 in a remote town, causing massive property damage as well as causing, at current estimates, thirty civilian casualties. Recontainment of SCP-4273 took 5 hours after it had breached containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Show&amp;nbsp;incident&amp;nbsp;timeline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Collapse&amp;nbsp;incident&amp;nbsp;timeline&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 enters [REDACTED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 process to come to a stop. It remains this way for 2 minutes,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 proceeds to ram itself into a tall building, causing the structure to collapse on top of it. SCP-4273 does not seem to be affected in any way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;local law enforcement proceeded to approach SCP-4273 and open fire on SCP-4273 once it turned to face them, showing no driver. SCP-4273 retaliates by opening fire. All of the officers were killed in the ensuing firefight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 continues to destroy major parts of [REDACTED], killing 5 more civilians.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After demolishing several more buildings in the area, SCP-4273 proceeds to move to the center of [REDACTED], before SCP-4273 proceeds to violently skid to a halt, hitting several pedestrians. Said pedestrians were confirmed dead upon impact.SCP-4273 narrowly avoids hitting an inflatable santa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Containment teams proceeded to attempt to recontain SCP-4273. 15 agents were maimed during the initial recontainment. 2 Helicopters were dispatched to assist with recontainment. MTF-Pi-1 is dispatched to aid in containment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 proceeds to engage helicopters, eliminating both via the ZPU turret and M6 flamethrower. SCP-4273 appears to be extremely protective of the inflatable santa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 evades all containment attempts for the next 13 minutes until a random bullet hits the santa, causing it to slowly deflate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 ceases movement and all hostilities. At this point, MTF-Epsilon-212 arrives and attempts to use SCP-4273-1 to regain control of SCP-4273.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273’s hood ornament glows intensly, proceeds to accelerate and rams into the containment truck. SCP-4273 then attempts to escape. SCP-4273-1 is lost for five minutes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 rams into a blockade, causing Agent ██████ to break his spine, paralyzing him.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two tanks are deployed to combat SCP-4273. During this time SCP-4273-1 is retrieved by containment personnel and Agent ██████ is tasked with entering SCP-4273 and inserting SCP-4273-1 into the key slot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upon arrival, SCP-4273 engages both tanks, destroying one of them before being bombarded by artillery. SCP-4273s main front guns and turret are destroyed while SCP-4273 suffers minor harm, having several dents and rust spots covering it, despite the bombardment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 proceeds to burn several buildings, before ramming itself into the other tank. Bloodstains are visible on the hood of SCP-4273.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 proceeds to violently destry several other buildings except those displaying holiday themes. At this time an airstrike was ordered by MTF-Epsilon-212.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent ███████ has climbed onto and jumped off of a small building directly onto SCP-4273. SCP-4273 Attempts to remove Agent ███████ by raming itself into several buildings. All remaining tanks and personnel were told to hold fire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent ███████ enters SCP-4273, while the SCP attempts to engage all other vehicles in sight. Due to quick thinking by MTF-Epsilon-212 by hastily decorating several vehicles and personnel, no weaponry was used.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent ███████’s head hits the steering wheel after SCP-4273 rams into a non decorated tank, causing him to go unconscious.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-302767-18&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;18&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; SCP-4273 proceeds to attempt to leave the area. Barricades were put in place to prevent any attempt at further escape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent ███████ recovers after a minute and hastily attempts to insert SCP-4273-1 into SCP-4273. Agent ███████ successfully inserts SCP-4273-1 into SCP-4273, subduing the SCP. Agent ███████ is successful in leaving SCP-4273 so it may be recontained. Agent ████ unintentionally forgets to call off the airstrike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The airstrike hits SCP-4273. Despite being hit with over [REDACTED], SCP-4273 remained operational, despite being heavily rusted, dented, and burned. Several of the weapons have been destroyed, rendering SCP-4273 defenceless. MTF-Epsilon-212 proceeds to load SCP-4273 into a vehicle loader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4273 has been successfully recontained. All and all witnesses were given class-B amnestics and MTF-Pi-1 succeeded in creating a cover story of a terrorist attack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Containment procedures have been revised to accommodate this behavior. While it is currently unknown why or even how SCP-4273 was able to operate without SCP-4273-1, We have speculated that SCP-4273 may possess some form of autonomy. However that would not explain its escape from the site, specifically built to contain large non sentient movable objects. I recommend we make preparations in the event this does happen again, possibly with modifications to its containment cell. We cannot afford another breach, as the amount of resources and repairs we had to make was well over our annual budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-Sparks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; After another attempted breach a year later, containment procedures have been revised to include this behavior. Further research into this behavior is pending.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;After-Incident-Report-4273-CB/R&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RECOVERED INTELLEGENCE-4273-CB/R&lt;br /&gt;
After this event, MTF-Epsilon-12 had uncovered a mass production facility in [REDACTED]. Although the facility was in a state of severe neglect, several documents were found detailing the usage and means of production SCP-4273 underwent. Additionally, an advertisement for SCP-4273 was found, dating as far back as 1950. &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;No explanation for the date, manufacturing, or even potential sales have been found to support the time of print however.&lt;/span&gt; G.O.I-XXX Documentation has begun under recent discoveries. View both [DATA EXPUNGED] for more details. A note found on the back was also found, confirming SCP-4273 may indeed be sentient to a degree.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;Show&amp;nbsp;recovered&amp;nbsp;advertisement&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Collapse&amp;nbsp;recovered&amp;nbsp;advertisement&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Illegible. Text is covered by a sticker attached reading “Just in time for the holidays!”&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-302767-19&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;19&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If so, you clearly have not purchased Arnex Convayance&#039;s newest line of combat transportation, the D.A.T! That stands for Defensive Assault Trucks people! Not only have we made another vehicle capable of wiping out your neighboring city, but this time it can fend for itself! Watch it fight on its own, tearing through anyone who isn’t its owner! Plus, as an added bonus, this time it can protect its driver!-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Easy to use as 123!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Simply insert the bonded key* and presto! You&#039;re ready to claim the roads as your own! Only one signature from one of our five head factories is all that is needed to get one for yourself!**&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don’t Worry folks! We still have our other combat vehicles you just can’t seem to get enough of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact -███-████-████ for more details and get your very own!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[A large image of SCP-4273 with all of its components armed is shown in the center of the poster. A small family of four are standing next to it, with the youngest hanging from the [REDACTED].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;All forms and contracts must be signed completely and willingly. Renex Industries is not responsible for any accidents that occur when the product is improperly used. Do not use during the 25th of december.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;If the key is lost/destroyed, contact ███-███-████ for a new one, or for repair. It is advised to stay away from the D.A.T. until representatives arrive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;** &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;Preferably the Vehicle and Transportation Division, although the Assault and Defense Division is also available, as is the Head Division. The Gear and Attire Division along with the Health and Medical Division are last resorts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;Jim, we have a problem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;You’re whole “Use anything similar to a horse” plan is about to get us all into some deep trouble.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;I would not worry usually but unfortunately the boss is coming by to make sure we make the delivery on time. How do you plan on explaining to him why we started using reindeer instead of the mares?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;I get trying to find a replacement for the mares is hard, but for god’s sake, we needed those reindeer for the jet sleds! Not this.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;And before you start asking what the big deal is, it&#039;s that they won’t start up and act like they’re supposed to. Boss wants these things moving by christmas, but it seems they&#039;ll only move DURING christmas. We need them to be ALWAYS active, like an actual animal, not some once a year zombie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;I don’t know what he’ll think, but odds are once he finds out his rage will be much more desirable than the big boss, which is saying something.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:xx-small;&quot;&gt;Also, we lost the one with the glowing red hood ornament. He’s gonna be pissed once he finds out.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-ash-krueger&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2341051&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608952241&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Ash Krueger&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2341051)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-ash-krueger&quot;  &gt;Dr Ash Krueger&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Personnel with Level 1 clearance are prohibited from coming into contact with SCP-4273.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Decoy building 98-C may be used for family/friend gatherings, to maintain moral and security.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Testing has shown the horsepower of SCP-4273 may very well be . SCP-4273 is composed of an unknown metallic material capable of generating and resisting extreme temperatures, the highest recorded being 7,092ºC.[[footnote]]The default amount of heat generated has been comparable to the earth’s core.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. It is for this reason that SCP-4273 has a tesla coil docking station in the containment chamber.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. It is for this reason a package of C4 is located within SCP-4273’s containment chamber in the form of a present.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. See &lt;strong&gt;After-Incident-Report-4273-RC&lt;/strong&gt; for more details.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. This can also be caused by faulty maintenance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;See Addendum: 4273-A-R/R&lt;/strong&gt;for more details.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. Approximately two weeks after the event, Dr. ██████ attempted to activate SCP-4273 before [DATA EXPUNGED]. This was also the first time that SCP-4273 seemed to respond “flawlessly” to its driver&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. ██████ was later confirmed to have been scheduled to perform with SCP-4273 before the attack&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. accompanied by an image of what appears to show a snowflake pattern of construction tools and various weaponry, and an electrified hammer in the center.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. see Document-4273-p-G.O.I-XX&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-13&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;. See &lt;strong&gt;Document 4273-T2-A&lt;/strong&gt; for full information on tests conducted with trailers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-14&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;14&lt;/a&gt;. around the size of the fourth largest recorded domestic horse&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-15&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;15&lt;/a&gt;. It is for this reason SCP-4273 has not been disassembled to examine.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-16&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;16&lt;/a&gt;. It is currently unknown if the individual is the owner or an employee of the company.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-17&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;17&lt;/a&gt;. At least 3/4ths of site-95 were completely eradicated.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-18&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;18&lt;/a&gt;. Examination afterward showed Agent had suffered a mild concussion.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-302767-19&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;19&lt;/a&gt;. the placing of the sticker suggests it was added hastily.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
